Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:09.65,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:09.33,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:12.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
