Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:15.52,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:19.33,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:23.81,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:26.09,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:28.85,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:31.10,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:36.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:40.24,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:45.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:45.04,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:49.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:48.85,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:49.54,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:50.69,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:55.01,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:54.34,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:55.05,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:56.24,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:02:00.75,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:04.18,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:06.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:07.37,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:09.97,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:08.94,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:12.72,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.62,0:02:13.00,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:15.23,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:15.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:17.95,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:20.57,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:21.08,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:22.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
